WEBVTT

00:50:59.921 --> 00:51:01.149
as to what that's like

00:51:01.173 --> 00:51:03.617
in a country with a very different
set of trade-offs

00:51:03.641 --> 00:51:05.585
they're having to make between lockdown

00:51:05.609 --> 00:51:09.767
and giving the most impoverished a chance.

00:51:09.791 --> 00:51:14.656
And then, a wide-ranging discussion
with Fareed Zakaria,

00:51:14.680 --> 00:51:17.760
who, you know, has this global view --

00:51:17.784 --> 00:51:19.458
you will have seen him on CNN --

00:51:19.482 --> 00:51:23.474
he's got this very
broad-ranging global view

00:51:23.498 --> 00:51:25.711
as to how to think about this thing.

00:51:25.735 --> 00:51:29.418
And to compare the different responses
of different countries.

00:51:29.442 --> 00:51:31.768
I think it's going to be
an amazing conversation,